      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "\"Hateful\" is used to describe things that fall under the category of \"hate speech\", in other words, bigotry, discrimination, etc in all forms, whether it be verbal, written (in bio/username/status/etc), or other. \n\n\"Harassing\" is used to denote targeted harassment of a specific person for any reason. Harassment takes many forms such as stalking, crashing, bullying, etc. \n\nThese two things are very different in definition, and in my opinion, that much is pretty clear if you know what the words mean to begin with.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
